{
  "initial_instruction": "앞서 설계한 macOS 기본 설치형 다중 CLI 데스크톱 앱을 실제 구현으로 진행하라는 요청. 앱은 Claude Code CLI, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, OpenCode를 특정 CLI 종속 없이 쉽게 세팅하고 다중 실행할 수 있어야 하며, 이번 구현은 안전하게 시작 가능한 실제 slice를 만들어야 한다.",
  "result_summary": "Implemented the first bounded desktop supervisor MVP: Tauri now exposes allowlisted CLI adapter discovery and stdin-free `--version` health checks for Claude Code CLI, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, and OpenCode; Workspace Monitor now has a Desktop tab that calls the Tauri bridge when available, degrades safely in a browser, shows adapter availability/version, health reports, question candidates, and source-editing readiness. Updated view modes, requirements, spec, validation, research, plan, request trace, and close-out records. Interactive PTY, stdin writes, long-running source-affecting CLI execution, xterm.js/Monaco installation, and Rust/Tauri build remain follow-up work.",
